      "updated_at": "2026-10-11T13:27:11Z",
      "body": "Source-grounded peer review at merged main bb4d01616bed889d17deb43434b59d4bf8b0d81f: the recorded intervention needs a causal-scope correction. crates/uor-r4-training/src/stack_memory.rs:4 explicitly defines product-key memory as replacing an MLP; geometric_stack.rs:2964 dispatches it from mlp(), and layer_range_with_source at8342-8380 still executes geometric_read_with_source and then adds mlp(). Thus these sources do not show exact UOR addressed memory replacing context read/softmax search. The reported4heads/key_dim128/sub_keys256/top_k32 uses learned subkeys and learned values, not the H4(dim4,size120)/E8(dim8,size240) fixed codebooks or occurrence/version/content identity dereference. Please bind the executed binary/config to source if a different path was used, otherwise correct README/current-state/canonical record and the context-length MAC attribution to PKM feed-forward replacement. The primary WV bar pass remains observed; this is not a mechanism negative. Secondary BPB within0.02 is NOT_RUN, so conditional no-headline-loss KEEP/reset is not yet established. Also reconcile custody: the canonical record says models/runs bundled, while the next #2029 card says predecessor models permanently lost with a reaped noncanonical pod. Verify the actual cloud manifest/round-trip rather than assuming either. No peer source, job or lease was modified by this review.",
