      "body": "Additional independently reviewed P1 integration confound at immutable bb4d: geometric_stack.rs2503-2565 add_memory_layers reinserts ALL parameters belonging to a selected layer, not only memory.*. BTreeMap::extend overwrites the trained read weights/norm/age/null parameters as well as installing memory; dialogue-train calls it after loading init= at examples/geometric-stack.rs5348-5359. shapes() retains read parameters independently of memory (1990 onward). Existing fresh-memory test24832 lacks a trained-parent nonmemory preservation assertion. Detailed source/repair/test boundary: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2029#issuecomment-6109683449 . This is a tooling/integration blocker and causal confound, not a mechanism negative; no peer source/job/lease changed. Historical measured rows remain observations, but do not isolate memory-only intervention.",
